Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is Black Hanekawa back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought we sealed it away for good during Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:25.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:31.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the end, the meddlesome cat was just her impetus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ther real problem is Prez's stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Last time, she was able to let stress off just going wild like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se we sealed it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she builds up too much stress, it'll come back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:49.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stress, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like she has a bell around her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:55.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That does the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how you catch the meddlesome cat early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.31,0:01:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prez was complaining about her headaches around Golden Week too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taking that into account, it's like she was trying to lead you straight to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why she could only tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the problem is stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means it's a matter of what's causing that stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her family just like before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:27.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She held that stress in for seventeen years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It just cleared up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it really get that bad again this quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:52.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if we've got the reason, neither you nor I can do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:56.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think we have any option but to treat the symptoms when they pop up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:01:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right about that, but{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Oshino? You're being vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Prez does look pretty good in cat ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of "Neko Neko Fantasia".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You read it? It was drawn by Nekobe Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nekobe Neko drew Goldfish Warning, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Oshino, are you trying to trick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:35.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you bring out Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're up against a stupid cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have any options but her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, it never rains. It pours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad luck brings along its friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off, Oshi{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino. There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:01.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I've wanted you to ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan left on a journey to find herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just a kid. She can't have gone very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's not like a vampire out of the legends anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm not near her, she's even weaker than a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she went to Mister Donut, she doesn't have a cent to her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:19.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's somewhere in this city, alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arraragi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally, just a typo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it was on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try as hard as I can to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:52.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, Araragi-san. Finding a lost child requires a lot of careful attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:59.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you try to do it all yourself, it's like finding a mummy in a pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:01.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A pyramid? That big?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:05.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You called me?\NI'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:15.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, I'll tell you a funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People in comics and anime seem to have it really easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but being a maid must be incredibly stressful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, "the Big Bear Cat lover"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:48.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling calmer now, Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hearing that again calmed me down somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, I want you to look for Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look for her? You mean she's gone?\NErr, Shinobu-chan, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's been gone since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just keep in mind that she's still a vampire, even if she's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Kanbaru Suruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:22.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kanbaru Suruga. My specialty is the B-dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kanbaru Suruga. Currently employed as Araragi-senpai's love slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a complete and total lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That voice, that retort. It has to be Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. Anyway, Kanbaru, are you at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's not like you to guess wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm at the supermarket's arcade machines playing "Chic Witches: Love and Berry".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to guess that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've blown almost three thousand yen on it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's tons of kids lined up behind me, but I don't feel like letting them play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.27,0:07:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit always fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mustn't lose my sense of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While we're talking about playing, lately, when I've played President with my friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? You were "the Posturing Waggler"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinobu ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A runaway? Got it.\NThat's all you need to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means I should strip, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you want me to look for that cute blonde girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:33.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Senjougahara. Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday a friend and I went to a video rental place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're "Walk toward the apple"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:56.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinobu's gone. I'd like you to help find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:04.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does this have anything to do with Hanekawa-san not coming to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.\NHanekawa's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san said last time there was a problem with Hanekawa-san, that Shinobu girl worked really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need her power for Hanekawa-san, but she's gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be worried about both of them very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:34.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's obvious you should put one before the other, but not doing so is very much like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:38.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm busy preparing for the school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.67,0:09:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, but right now{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just abandon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The worse off Hanekawa-san is, the more important it is that I do this for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should do what you have to, just like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'll do what I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, school's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have a great school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll keep in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the the way, Araragi-kun. Can I tell you one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsundere service.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you don't come back I'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:48.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on. Of course I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That takes a load off my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:55.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've called in as much help as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinobu. Oshino Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find her. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for you for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:56.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Purrr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me like that, humyan. Purrr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acting all cute isn't going to get you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weren't you tied up, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if I feel like stirring up more trouble I can just let myself loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd you sneak by Oshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moving without making noise is like taking candy from a baby, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:28.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino, you've been pretty useless this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You let Shinobu and Black Hanekawa get away. That's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Repeat after me, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:13:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine an imaginary menagerie manager\Nimagining managing an imaginary menagerie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:07.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90}Can mew imyagine an imyaginyary mewnyagerie mewnyager imyagining mewnyaging an imyaginyary mewnyagerie?{Lined up at a seventy-seven degree angle, a sobbing and neighing 750cc bike is easily provocation level seven. lol.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So damn cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked you, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:16.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, is that how you say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:22.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came to help you out, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like fighting you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you that before, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:36.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before? You mean this morning at school?\NDid you tell me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't myatter, I'm telling you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:45.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like going wild this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm tense about, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:53.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a reflection of Hanekawa's stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You appeared so Hanekawa could let some of that stress off.\NYou're like another personality of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my way of thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.93,0:14:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}After all, my myaster was able to work through as much stress in those nine days as she normally could in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean you're on my side?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're better off the sooner we find Shinobu too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, meow!{I've wanted to make her say this since this show was announced.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, you can lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nyahaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this what they mean by "gold coins to a cyat"?{no one cares about proverbs}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:37.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My Hanekawa would never be so amused by that bad of a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:41.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can help with your sense of smell and hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know Shinobu's voice and scent, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should follow her that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll drive. If you notice anything, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, humyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:16.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot about her energy drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see if I can get away with saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Araragi, do not regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Humyan, my myaster's boobs felt so great that you fainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may be dumb, but you're a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:37.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't realize your own power, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:41.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I really be counting on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:48.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gotten too dark for a human to spot Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want to see? Nyahaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:05.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really not sure I should be counting on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:12.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, stupid cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like you went through a lot after the last time you took me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:20.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With us aberrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, Oshino told you about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. There was a crab, and a snail, and a monkey, and a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, a nue?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just react to the monkey and snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are the crab and snail parts on one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't just spout off whatever you think up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now I'm a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, humyan, what do you think of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of what you call "aberrations"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:51.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do I think of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:17:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you think you're going to just get along with us, you've bitten off more than you can chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An aberration is an aberration. A humyan is a humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They cyan't be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No myatter what, they're incompyatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.45,0:17:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:14.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't get it, it's your own fault for being so dumb, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You of all people saying that is really scarring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is the scarred...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what you mean is that I'll never be able to get along with aberrations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.85,0:17:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I'm trying to say, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For example.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you considered why that vyampire ran off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:46.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how little you really know about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's purrobably why the guy in the Hawaiian shirt's guesses end up being right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, he's at least polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Polite?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He knows his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:09.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must be...\Nbelieved in,\Nfeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,be afraid of,\Navoided,\Nrespected,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:15.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,worshiped,\Nhated,\Ndespised,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and receive wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why we exist, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting along with us is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Approaching us as a friend is just annoying, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:31.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, you said that's why you exist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So by treating Shinobu like a little girl, I destroyed Shinobu as an aberration?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Purrhaps, purrhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't thought it through that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't smell her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't smell Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me just how many of her powers that vyampire can still manifest, humyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she can still appear and disappear, or turn into a shadow, I won't be able to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She can't really manifest any.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They only work when I'm around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm not there, she's just a ki{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's going to take a bit more effort to find that vyampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she can't be outside the city. Right now, she can't exist that far away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A vyampire drinks blood, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A vyampire drinks human blood. But drinking it for a meal and making a follower are purretty different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's exactly why she ran away, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.41,0:20:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're really dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.37,0:20:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have enjoyed watching you get involved with so many of us without even a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:20.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean she feels less special being held up against all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why she couldn't stand staying there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do if you don't find her, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed.\NHanekawa won't go back to normal, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.99,0:20:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Except for what's going on with my myaster, purrhaps you'd be better off without the vyampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, with her gone, you can go back to being humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't even care if she kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she dies tomorrow, I may as well die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.27,0:21:09.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a way to bottle me byack up without relying on a vyampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:23.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the purrsonification of my myaster's stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the source of my myaster's stress is dealt with, I'll go away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino thought of that too, but I can't figure out what's stressing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm its purrsonification.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you of all people can deal with it easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My myaster is so dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She loves you, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So if you fall in love with my myaster, I think that might bottle me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NI'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:23:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan's kind of{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:23:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up with onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.44,0:24:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing how few friends he has?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.11,0:24:05.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we shouldn't make a point of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's not talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.03,0:24:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not having friends isn't lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not having friends is lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.03,0:24:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, then let's put loneliness positively!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.83,0:24:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a soloist.\NSoloist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.04,0:24:16.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That makes loneliness sound better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.00,0:24:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it makes being a soloist sound worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.37,0:24:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preview quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.29,0:24:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.29,0:24:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think they're a friend, but are they really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.63,0:24:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.59,0:24:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, final episode!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:27.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsubasa Cat part five.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they really are a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.38,0:24:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's even scarier!
